    {
      "text": "Master, we know that thou art true, Matt. 22:16 (Mark 12:14). who will commit to your trust the true riches, Luke 16:11. That was the true Light, John 1:9. testimony hath set to his seal that God is true, John 3:33. true worshippers shall worship the Father, John 4:23. my Father giveth you the true bread, John 6:32. he that sent me is true, John 7:28. Jesus answered … my record is true, John 8:14. testimony of two men is true, John 8:17. he that sent me is true, John 8:26. I am the true vine, John 15:1 (1 Ne. 15:15). that they might know thee the only true God, John 17:3. he that saw it bare record, and his record is true, John 19:35. we know that his testimony is true, John 21:24. let God be true, but every man a liar, Rom. 3:4. whatsoever things are true, Philip. 4:8. from idols to serve the living and true God, 1 Thes. 1:9. true tabernacle, which the Lord pitched, Heb. 8:2. Christ is not entered into the holy places made with hands, which are the figures of the true, Heb. 9:24. Let us draw near with a true heart, Heb. 10:22. true light now shineth, 1 Jn. 2:8. This is the true God, 1 Jn. 5:20. These things saith … he that is true, Rev. 3:7. just and true are thy ways, thou King of saints, Rev. 15:3. God Almighty, true and righteous are thy judgments, Rev. 16:7. he that sat upon him was called Faithful and True, Rev. 19:11. these words are true and faithful, Rev. 21:5 (22:6).",
