      "text": "remnants … grafted in, or come to the knowledge of the true Messiah, 1 Ne. 10:14 (2 Ne. 1:10; 25:18). records of the prophets and … apostles of the Lamb are true, 1 Ne. 13:39. words of my Beloved are true and faithful, 2 Ne. 31:15. doctrine of Christ … true doctrine of the Father, 2 Ne. 31:21. restore the Lamanites unto the true faith, Enos 1:20. put their trust in the true and living God, Alma 5:13. whatsoever I shall say unto you, concerning that which is to come, is true, Alma 5:48. if it be a true seed … it will begin to swell, Alma 32:28. men who were true at all times, Alma 53:20. shall again be brought to the true knowledge, Hel. 15:13. we know our record to be true, 3 Ne. 8:1. Gentiles … know of the true points of my doctrine, 3 Ne. 21:6 (D&C 10:62). began to deny the true church, 4 Ne. 1:26. they did persecute the true church, 4 Ne. 1:29. possess this land … should serve him, the true and only God, Ether 2:8. ask God … if these things are not true, Moro. 10:4. God shall show … that which I have written is true, Moro. 10:29.",
